      "expected_code": "unsupported_triton_memory_effect",
      "note": "The qualified upstream 3.6.0 language has no async/await entry; the request is expressed through tl.range(num_stages=...), which asks the compiler to stage loads asynchronously through shared memory. The LLK CPU executor has no such staging, so the exporter rejects the loop's tt.num_stages attribute."
    },
